  2965	- **Voluntary administration, if the chapter uses the 2024/2026 events at all, is a distinct legal
  2966	  status from liquidation or bankruptcy** under Australian insolvency law, and this task did not
  2967	  source those events primary-hand — so the safer instruction is to not use them without a future
  2968	  task doing that sourcing properly, rather than risk the chapter stating a legal outcome (sold,
  2969	  liquidated, restructured, returned to the founders) this entry cannot back with a document.
